      "content": "Photos from 湯姆熊歡樂世界-台南海佃店's post\n1024✨G3陀螺官方賽✨<br />\n<br />\n兩個月一期的G3的官方賽<br />\n最後一場在今天結束囉~<br />\n感謝所有來賓的參與<br />\n也恭喜這幾次前三名拿到限定零件的朋友唷😊<br />\n<br />\n11....",
      "full_text": "Photos from 湯姆熊歡樂世界-台南海佃店's post\n1024✨G3陀螺官方賽✨<br />\n<br />\n兩個月一期的G3的官方賽<br />\n最後一場在今天結束囉~<br />\n感謝所有來賓的參與<br />\n也恭喜這幾次前三名拿到限定零件的朋友唷😊<br />\n<br />\n11.12月如果還有安排G3賽事<br />\n一樣會在海電電FB粉絲團公告<br />\n請大家持續鎖定唷👍<br />\n<br />\n#戰鬥陀螺 #官方賽 #台南 #海佃 #湯姆熊<br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"https://scontent-cdg6-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/861525438_1562568199224784_4573749370854393874_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=wAJrduPFcZcQ7kNvwEHYMzC&amp;_nc_oc=AdpvKS7tgyZ0tYWbgJ24I9bDPyuGCye-hBUUueai_31UfK-GTnsQRMIHFu8uzJYalhQ&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-cdg6-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=yRq_nAwjbFYfMg87TmBilg&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKO-y-IXO-PcyrwxgPs3YtI2cdSWF33DW04D5OuqwiyhFNoG78Cq14nrb1Z2vKM9ijVTA2B3HQL&amp;oh=00_AQNigBfTL5FDHMO8_0FmpBiD_j_Tmt4cU4BwLNXWFmfZuA&amp;oe=6AE41624\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-cdg6-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/862850795_1562568812558056_5073562579851793284_n.jpg?stp=cp1_dst-jpegr_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=PiSajGgGFVoQ7kNvwHJgLA8&amp;_nc_oc=Adp93f-kKWrdC0-c1NIadf0SE6dsZNNVSDfi3l6gCYRb9vXOdM_kAN9q_HQk5nPHs7U&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;se=-1&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-cdg6-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=yRq_nAwjbFYfMg87TmBilg&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQIPlQJrTPmoqZU4jniMoGo9wqltmWXLLlyfxXBoMei_3YnxpYhXBxX1oc4I3X9XvRJXWw3Y6P3X&amp;oh=00_AQNOSc7hkgm5fnTJLwIsVRARbj6k-WQ-tUrstz7SzK1jiQ&amp;oe=6AE40685\" width=\"720\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-cdg6-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/861217877_1562568825891388_430941940602498468_n.jpg?stp=cp1_dst-jpegr_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=8gGK6F23LXUQ7kNvwHBymLn&amp;_nc_oc=AdrEjwgI57wVFqHLCAAkT4ntUHil_jSGppF2qJJuvFt64vpFG5pTZgN4ZcHRKkzHCLg&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;se=-1&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-cdg6-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=yRq_nAwjbFYfMg87TmBilg&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKtfsHDZk13jNmM6zsfIOFEQO9JBn8pe9KYJi2bKursim